From 0e46bf22d88b52deadd6b02466b4660a2f7a8e59 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Michael Rowlinson <mrowlinson@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 08:10:53 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 06/23] avcodec/ac4: add encoder static tables

Huffman, A-SPX, and SFB-offset tables shared by the native AC-4
encoder core. Pure data, no dependencies; the OBJS entries sit
under CONFIG_AC4_ENCODER, still undefined, so this patch is a
build no-op until the wrapper patch registers the codec.

Re-cut (r3): prepend the standard LGPL header block (Copyright (c)
2026 Michael Rowlinson) to all 6 table files (X2); table bytes
otherwise identical to r2.

Re-cut (r5): complete the M3 AC4_ rename for the 34 AJOC/DE/DRC
huffman table symbols (definitions + registry uses + header decls;
string-literal book names kept); table bytes identical to r4. Fixes
the A+C duplicate-symbol link collision (the decoder huffman_tab.o
defines the same 34 globals).

Re-cut (r6): rename to ac4_*_tab.* (M10: *_tables.* match
libavcodec CLEANFILES + .gitignore and would be deleted by
make clean; the decoder already uses *_tab). Table bytes identical
to r5.

Signed-off-by: Michael Rowlinson <mrowlinson@gmail.com>
---
 libavcodec/Makefile          |    2 +
 libavcodec/ac4_aspx_tab.c    |  361 +++++++++++
 libavcodec/ac4_aspx_tab.h    |   95 +++
 libavcodec/ac4_huffman_tab.c | 1153 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 libavcodec/ac4_huffman_tab.h |  186 ++++++
 libavcodec/ac4_sfb_offsets.c |  166 +++++
 libavcodec/ac4_sfb_offsets.h |   34 +
 7 files changed, 1997 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 libavcodec/ac4_aspx_tab.c
 create mode 100644 libavcodec/ac4_aspx_tab.h
 create mode 100644 libavcodec/ac4_huffman_tab.c
 create mode 100644 libavcodec/ac4_huffman_tab.h
 create mode 100644 libavcodec/ac4_sfb_offsets.c
 create mode 100644 libavcodec/ac4_sfb_offsets.h

diff --git a/libavcodec/Makefile b/libavcodec/Makefile
index 4c226a7..ae99bbb 100644
--- a/libavcodec/Makefile
+++ b/libavcodec/Makefile
@@ -219,6 +219,8 @@ OBJS-$(CONFIG_AC3_FIXED_DECODER)       += ac3dec_fixed.o ac3dec_data.o ac3.o \
 OBJS-$(CONFIG_AC3_ENCODER)             += ac3enc_float.o ac3enc.o ac3tab.o \
                                           ac3.o kbdwin.o
 OBJS-$(CONFIG_AC3_FIXED_ENCODER)       += ac3enc_fixed.o ac3enc.o ac3tab.o ac3.o kbdwin.o
+OBJS-$(CONFIG_AC4_ENCODER)             += ac4_huffman_tab.o \
+                                          ac4_aspx_tab.o ac4_sfb_offsets.o
 OBJS-$(CONFIG_AC3_MF_ENCODER)          += mfenc.o mf_utils.o
 # AC-4 decoder: wrapper + vendored streaming core (in-tree port).
 # No extra libs/flags.
diff --git a/libavcodec/ac4_aspx_tab.c b/libavcodec/ac4_aspx_tab.c
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..b5b47d4
--- /dev/null
+++ b/libavcodec/ac4_aspx_tab.c
